        "body": "## Summary\n- point missing-login errors to `https://ollama.com/signin`\n- stop directing signed-out users to the protected settings page\n- keep recovery guidance consistent across missing-session errors\n\n## Live proof\nRedacted live Ollama response on 2026-07-06:\n\n```text\nGET https://ollama.com/settings\nHTTP/2 303\nlocation: /signin\nset-cookie: aid=<redacted>\n```\n\nThe current settings page itself sends signed-out users to `/signin`, matching the new recovery URL. No browser cookie or Keychain access was used.\n\n## Tests\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageFetcherTests` (19 passed)\n- changed Swift files pass SwiftFormat and SwiftLint strict\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`\n\n## Commits\n- exactly 3: implementation, tests, documentation",
